  "claim": "The Ilion Animation Studios produced CGI-animated film from 2009 was 3D. The 2009 animated film written and directed by Phil Lord and Christopher Miller was not in 3D.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs (film). Sentence: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs is a 2009 American computer-animated science fiction comedy film loosely based on the 1978 children's book of the same name by Judi and Ron Barrett.\nPage: Planet 51. Sentence: Planet 51 is a 2009 Spanish and American-British-movie 3D computer-animated science fiction comedy film directed by Jorge Blanco, written by Joe Stillman, and starring Dwayne Johnson, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, Seann William Scott, and John Cleese.\nPage: Phil Lord and Christopher Miller. Sentence: They are known for directing and writing the animated films \"Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs\" (2009) and \"The Lego Movie\" (2014), as well as directing the live-action comedy film \"21 Jump Street\" (2012) and its sequel (2014).\nPage: Ilion Animation Studios. Sentence: Ilion produced the CGI-animated film, \"Planet 51\".",
